            "detailed_description": "<h1>Características</h1><p><strong>5 vs 1 Hockey Action</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take on up to 5 players in the Hailstone Arena!</li></ul><strong>Create Your Own Plays</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Position your opponents wherever you want in the offensive zone!</li></ul><strong>Full Body Motion with the HTC Vive Trackers</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Make acrobatic saves or stack the pads just like the pros!</li></ul><strong>Real-Time Multiplayer</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Face off against your friends using our GoalieVR Mobile App available at .</li></ul></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Experience the adrenaline rush of defending your goal against 5 opposing players, an unrealistic but FUN experience. Play against AI or your friends (requires a compatible iOS or Android mobile device).",
